      "question": "What is Purnabramha?",
      "answer": "Purnabramha is the world's first intelligent restaurant chain specializing in authentic Maharashtrian cuisine. Founded in 2012 by Jayanti Kathale, it's a women-led brand serving traditional Marathi dishes including Thali, Solkadhi, Puranpoli, Vada Pav, and Misal Pav across India and Australia."
