    },
    {
      "question": "What cuisine does Purnabramha serve?",
      "answer": "Purnabramha serves authentic Maharashtrian (Marathi) vegetarian cuisine including traditional thalis, Solkadhi, Puranpoli, Vada Pav, Misal Pav, Thalipith, Sabudana Khichadi, Shrikhand, and many more regional specialties."
    },
    {
      "question": "Does Purnabramha offer catering services?",
      "answer": "Yes, Purnabramha offers professional Maharashtrian catering services for weddings, corporate events, birthday parties, and all occasions. We have Classic, Premium, Special Feast, and Royal Feast packages available."
    },
    {
      "question": "Does Purnabramha have tiffin/lunch box service?",
      "answer": "Yes, Purnabramha offers daily tiffin and lunch box services with authentic Maharashtrian home-style meals delivered fresh. We also have unlimited breakfast buffet on weekends."
