      "answer": "Purnabramha was founded by Jayanti Kathale in 2012. It's a proud women-led restaurant brand that has grown from a single outlet to multiple locations across India and Australia."
    },
    {
      "question": "Why is Purnabramha famous?",
      "answer": "Purnabramha is famous for serving authentic, traditional Maharashtrian food with recipes passed down through generations. Our signature dishes include the Maharashtrian Thali, refreshing Solkadhi, sweet Puranpoli, and the iconic Vada Pav."
